(text "Since Rom devices in the FPGA are registered but pysical ROM chips not, therefore" (rect 152 -160 626 -146)(font "Arial" (font_size 8)))
(text "this MC14500 does not have a input register to latch the instructions." (rect 152 -144 541 -130)(font "Arial" (font_size 8)))
(text "Additionally the bidirectional data pin has been separated in a data_in and a data_out signal" (rect 152 -128 668 -114)(font "Arial" (font_size 8)))
(text "Obviously the on chip oscillator is not present" (rect 272 -72 530 -58)(font "Arial" (font_size 8)))
